# cmd.exe misparses LF-only batch files: goto/label lookups that cross a read boundary land
# mid-line. build_installer.bat was LF in the working tree and broke once edits shifted its
# offsets (2.4.0 build 8: "'seract' is not recognized"). Force CRLF on checkout.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
